00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:16.930
And now let’s discuss the advantages of
the iPad Pro.

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:19.570
For starters, it’s much more portable than
any MacBook.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:24.150
It’s both smaller, thinner and much lighter,
so it’s easy to carry around.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.740
Another perk is that you have the choice of
